.14902 .215686 .27451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 39.15 Tm /F1 9.25 Tf 12.1 TL (Health information is often spread across clinics, paper files, and separate digital systems. Patients may have difficulty) Tj T* (locating records when changing providers, while clinicians may lack timely access to relevant history. At the same time,) Tj T* (sharing sensitive information without clear patient permission raises privacy concerns. HealthPass explores a) Tj T* (patient-focused way to organize health information and make selected records available through explicit, limited consent.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 50.64 576.2298 cm
q
.14902 .215686 .27451 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 39.15 Tm /F1 9.25 Tf 12.1 TL (The project is a healthcare technology web application prototype. It provides patient and professional workflows in a) Tj T* (browser-based interface and demonstrates consent decisions, record views, and related actions using fictional demo) Tj T* (data. It is intended to communicate a privacy-conscious model; it is not a production medical record service or a clinically) Tj T* (validated system.) Tj T* ET
